section: Albums
order: 4
method: GET
endpoint: /albums
---

## List Albums

```http
GET /albums?limit=20&offset=0
```

Returns a paginated list of albums in the catalog.

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
[
  {
    "id": "alb_9c4b2a",
    "artist_id": "art_3d8e1f",
    "title": "Manusia",
    "slug": "manusia",
    "year": 2022,
    "type": "album",
    "description": "Album studio kelima karya Tulus yang dirilis pada tahun 2022.",
    "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/alb_9c4b2a.webp",
    "cover_source": "deezer",
    "created_at": "2024-01-15T08:00:00Z"
  }
]
```

---

## Get Album Details & Tracklist

```http
GET /albums/:id
```

### Response (`200 OK`)

```json
{
  "id": "alb_9c4b2a",
  "artist_id": "art_3d8e1f",
  "artist_name": "Tulus",
  "title": "Manusia",
  "slug": "manusia",
  "year": 2022,
  "type": "album",
  "description": "Album studio kelima karya Tulus.",
  "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/alb_9c4b2a.webp",
  "tracks": [
    {
      "id": "trk_7f9a2b1c",
      "title": "Jatuh Suka",
      "track_number": 1,
      "duration": 224,
      "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_7f9a2b1c/playlist.m3u8"
    },
    {
      "id": "trk_8e2b1a9c",
      "title": "Hati-Hati di Jalan",
      "track_number": 2,
      "duration": 242,
      "audio_url": "https://api.lament.rynds.my.id/stream/trk_8e2b1a9c/playlist.m3u8"
    }
  ]
}
```

