## Refresh Album Artwork (Master Only)

```http
POST /refresh-image/albums/:id
```

### Headers

- `X-Master-Key`: `<your_master_secret>`

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "album_id": "alb_9c4b2a",
  "cover_url": "https://cdn.lament.rynds.my.id/covers/alb_9c4b2a.webp"
}
```
